 "runtimeOverhead": {
  "about": "The CPU of a pod outside its pod cgroup, in threads of the fastest node: kubelet, containerd, the shim and the runsc or Kata commands of its probes and statistics, measured from system.slice of each node against its count of gVisor sandboxes and Kata VMs. The idle value is a zone at rest. The start value is the 10 minutes after a zone create. overhead = idle + factor x (start - idle), rounded up to 10m, the rule of the requests. ../cluster/runtimeclasses.yaml holds the values as overhead.podFixed. shimMemory is the memory of the shim and the runsc process of one gVisor pod outside its pod cgroup (proportional set size, about 13.5 MiB on each node). The gVisor memoryOverhead is about twice that value. The Kata memoryOverhead covers the guest memory and the VMM (../cluster/runtimeclasses.yaml).",
  "measured": "2026-11-15, site of three nodes, one and two zones",
